Derived parts and modifications:
- app/src/main/java/ai/toolus/mobileguide/ScreenSnapshot.kt: Kotlin port of HierarchyDumper.snapshotNode and
  A11yNode.writeXml (packages/artemis-accessibility-helper). Modified to leave out this app's own windows and
  accessibility overlays, and to keep node handles for the guide catalog.

The app does not contain artemis itself. The artemis planner runs in the guide server
(https://github.com/youth-hackathon/haebom-artemis); the app sends it the screen and shows the one action it returns.
